<title>UK: Nomura says to invest in Poland's Impexmetal.</title>
<headline>Nomura says to invest in Poland's Impexmetal.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nomura International has underwritten and intends to subscribe for a major investor tranche in the public offering of Impexmetal SA, a leading Polish non-ferrous metals industrial company, the bank said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>Nomura underwrote 1,594,586 shares which represents approximately 15 percent of the enlarged share capital of the company at 36 Polish zloty per share.</p>
<p>This brings Nomura's total investment commitment to 57.4 million Polish zloty or $18.4 million.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom, +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
